Description: Bande power service: sleep locking, battery alerts and idle inhibition
 Locks the session before the computer sleeps through a logind delay
 inhibitor, makes the power button lock the session, posts low and
 critical battery notifications from UPower, serves
 org.freedesktop.ScreenSaver so applications can keep the screen on,
 holding a logind idle inhibitor for each request, and keeps the computer
 from sleeping when idle while a sound stream runs. Controls the
 brightness of each connected display that has one, through its backlight
 or DDC/CI.

